<view class="container privilege-page">
  <view class="privilege-hero">
    <view class="privilege-eyebrow">热念 · 特权卡</view>
    <view class="privilege-title">把一句“这次我答应你”做成一张卡</view>
    <view class="privilege-sub">
      发给 TA 的卡一次有效；只有收到卡的人能使用，使用后会留下记录。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card issue-card">
    <view class="card-title">发一张特权卡给 TA</view>

    <view class="preset-row">
      <view
        class="preset-chip"
        wx:for="{{presets}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        data-name="{{item}}"
        bindtap="choosePreset"
      >
        {{item}}
      </view>
    </view>

    <input
      class="card-input"
      value="{{name}}"
      placeholder="例如：和好一次"
      maxlength="20"
      bindinput="onNameInput"
    />

    <textarea
      class="card-note"
      value="{{note}}"
      placeholder="这张卡怎么用？写一句备注（选填）"
      maxlength="100"
      auto-height
      bindinput="onNoteInput"
    />

    <button
      class="issue-btn"
      bindtap="createCard"
      disabled="{{saving || !name}}"
    >
      发给 TA
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="section-head">
    <view>
      <view class="section-title">我收到的可用卡</view>
      <view class="section-sub">点“使用”后会立即消耗</view>
    </view>
    <view class="section-count">{{receivedActive.length}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{receivedActive.length}}">
    <view
      class="ticket ticket-received"
      wx:for="{{receivedActive}}"
      wx:key="id"
    >
      <view class="ticket-edge ticket-edge-left"></view>
      <view class="ticket-edge ticket-edge-right"></view>
      <view class="ticket-top">
        <view class="ticket-badge">TA 给我的</view>
        <view class="ticket-status">可使用</view>
      </view>
      <view class="ticket-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="ticket-note" wx:if="{{item.note}}">{{item.note}}</view>
      <view class="ticket-note ticket-note-empty" wx:else>没有额外说明</view>
      <view class="ticket-foot">
        <view class="ticket-time">{{item.createdLabel}}</view>
        <button
          class="use-btn"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="useCard"
        >
          使用
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="empty privilege-empty" wx:else>
    还没有收到可使用的特权卡 🎟️
  </view>

  <view class="section-head sent-head">
    <view>
      <view class="section-title">我发出的待使用</view>
      <view class="section-sub">TA 使用前，你可以撤回</view>
    </view>
    <view class="section-count">{{sentActive.length}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{sentActive.length}}">
    <view
      class="ticket ticket-sent"
      wx:for="{{sentActive}}"
      wx:key="id"
    >
      <view class="ticket-edge ticket-edge-left"></view>
      <view class="ticket-edge ticket-edge-right"></view>
      <view class="ticket-top">
        <view class="ticket-badge sent-badge">我给 TA</view>
        <view class="ticket-status">等待使用</view>
      </view>
      <view class="ticket-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="ticket-note" wx:if="{{item.note}}">{{item.note}}</view>
      <view class="ticket-note ticket-note-empty" wx:else>没有额外说明</view>
      <view class="ticket-foot">
        <view class="ticket-time">{{item.createdLabel}}</view>
        <view
          class="revoke-action"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="revokeCard"
        >
          撤回
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="empty privilege-empty" wx:else>
    没有等待 TA 使用的卡。
  </view>

  <view class="section-head history-head">
    <view>
      <view class="section-title">历史记录</view>
      <view class="section-sub">已使用和已撤回的卡都会留在这里</view>
    </view>
    <view class="section-count">{{history.length}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{history.length}}">
    <view
      class="history-row"
      wx:for="{{history}}"
      wx:key="id"
    >
      <view class="history-icon">{{item.status === 'used' ? '✨' : '↩'}}</view>
      <view class="history-body">
        <view class="history-top">
          <view class="history-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="history-status {{item.status === 'used' ? 'history-used' : 'history-revoked'}}">
            {{item.statusLabel}}
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="history-meta">
          {{item.directionLabel}}
          <text wx:if="{{item.status === 'used' && item.usedLabel}}"> · {{item.usedLabel}}</text>
          <text wx:elif="{{item.status === 'revoked' && item.revokedLabel}}"> · {{item.revokedLabel}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="history-note" wx:if="{{item.note}}">{{item.note}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="empty privilege-empty" wx:else>
    暂时还没有使用记录。
  </view>

  <view class="privilege-footnote">
    特权卡是双方的小约定，不代表对任何现实行为的强制同意；使用时仍应尊重彼此当下的意愿。
  </view>
</view>
